    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even an \"experience\" i guess. it's just my life. i do the things you're saying, i go to the shops, i go to the park, but i'm just a shadow. it's exhausting pretending like there's something to find here. it feels more like i'm just taking up space that could be used by someone who actually matters.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
