      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is draining to constantly perform when you feel unseen, and your feelings of insignificance are valid responses to that isolation. Remember that just existing and showing up *is* meaningful, even if you can't see the value in it right now. Instead of searching for a grand \"point,\" focus on tiny acts of self-kindness, like enjoying the beauty of the park, to validate your own presence. Be gentle with yourself as you navigate this challenging period of transition.",
      "source": "target",
