    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that just feels like more work. more pretending. i'm tired of trying to convince myself i matter when the reality is clearly different. it feels more like i'm just waiting for something to end. like, if i'm not really part of this world, why do i have to keep fighting to stay in it?",
